WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.556 --> 00:00:03.687
(upbeat music)

00:00:03.687 --> 00:00:05.157
- I think it's fun, making passwords;

00:00:05.157 --> 00:00:09.324
I don't like to do it from
9AM to 10 o'clock at night,

00:00:10.319 --> 00:00:12.349
but that's what comes
with having a business,

00:00:12.349 --> 00:00:13.292
you do the orders,

00:00:13.292 --> 00:00:16.756
you don't just get
money for doing nothing.

00:00:16.756 --> 00:00:21.623
Welcome to Keeping Up
With The Modi/Egglands.

00:00:21.623 --> 00:00:25.072
My name is Mira Modi, and
I love password making,

00:00:25.072 --> 00:00:26.210
as you know.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.960
One big happy family.

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:32.345
I make passwords that are very secure,

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:36.471
and I have a website where
I sell them for $2 each

00:00:36.471 --> 00:00:39.054
and I send them by postal mail.

00:00:44.998 --> 00:00:48.189
I roll dice to make strings of numbers,

00:00:48.189 --> 00:00:52.809
use the string of numbers
to get corresponding words

00:00:52.809 --> 00:00:55.059
in the diceware dictionary.

00:00:58.936 --> 00:01:01.368
I roll dice five times for each word,

00:01:01.368 --> 00:01:03.428
so you do that six times for one password.

00:01:03.428 --> 00:01:05.428
So, I roll dice 30 times

00:01:07.391 --> 00:01:10.286
and it produces random word

00:01:10.286 --> 00:01:12.596
that have a lot of entropy,

00:01:12.596 --> 00:01:16.763
which means it's not easy
for the computer to hack.

00:01:18.476 --> 00:01:20.291
Kind of, like, turned into a thing I would do

00:01:20.291 --> 00:01:22.083
like, if my mom's friends are like come over,

00:01:22.083 --> 00:01:23.762
and they're like hey, can you
make me a couple passwords,

00:01:23.762 --> 00:01:25.126
and I'd do it.

00:01:25.126 --> 00:01:26.773
Then I was like, “Oh, let's
make it into a website.”

00:01:26.773 --> 00:01:27.940
And here I am,

00:01:29.903 --> 00:01:33.124
and the website is kicking off,

00:01:33.124 --> 00:01:34.576
and I'm really excited about that.

00:01:34.576 --> 00:01:36.694
Some people, like, say being popular in school

00:01:36.694 --> 00:01:37.852
is the best thing ever,

00:01:37.852 --> 00:01:39.896
I think this is so much better.

00:01:39.896 --> 00:01:43.896
People actually learn
from this and that's good.

